                                                "sense_id": "ec2e6523-fe3e-3477-ba7b-9a8068673286",
                                                "text": "A number of nights now steer away from the EBM of yesteryear. The scene is alive and kicking with plenty of new bands that aren't reliant on synths."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1a7d4c7-0ad4-48a2-b6ec-f89106b908ab",
                                                "sense_id": "ec2e6523-fe3e-3477-ba7b-9a8068673286",
                                                "text": "Modern industrial music subgenres and fusion-genres include EBM, futurepop, power-noise, aggrotech (terror-EBM), coldwave, elektro, dark-electro, and industrial-metal. Yes, it can be quite confusing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
